OL,3,GNEWSACentenarian celebrates 100 years
OL,4,Ain same village
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs neighbours gathered for a surprise
OL,7,Fbirthday celebration, one woman became
OL,8,Fthe centre of attention in the
OL,9,FCambridgeshire village she has called
OL,10,Fhome for a century.
OL,12,FFor 100 years, Kath Rayner has lived in
OL,13,FHarston and raised her own family
OL,14,Fthere. She celebrated her centenarian
OL,15,Fyear on Wednesday.
OL,17,FA surprise party was held for her
OL,18,Fbirthday at the village hall.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
