OL,3,GNEWSACentenarian celebrates 100 years
OL,4,Ain same village
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow living with her son, who is also
OL,7,Fher carer, she said: "It's always been
OL,8,Fmy home and school and everything... I
OL,9,Fdon't want to go nowhere else ` never
OL,10,Fthought about it."
